  "title": "Scottish Mince Pie",
  "description": "My mother-in-law made this pie in Scotland. I serve it with boiled parsley potatoes and a nice salad.",
  "authors": [
    "Karen Barbour"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-03-09T18:10:57-05:00",
